sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant A as KnowledgeAssistant
  participant S as ChromaStore
  participant C as Chroma collection
  U->>A: ask(question)
  A->>S: query(question, where?)
  S->>C: query_texts + filter
  C-->>S: ids, documents, distances
  S-->>A: QueryHits
  A->>A: extractive grounded answer
  A-->>U: answer + citations
